<script type="text/javascript">
    // Guide-proof exception (as on I.20, I.23, I.31, I.46): the guide below
    // narrates the X.33 lemma proof step by step, so the captions are Dr.
    // Joyce's own sentences. This is the "why Euclid did it the hard way"
    // counterpoint — the same result via proportion and similarity, which
    // needs Books V and VI and so could not stand in Book I.
    //
    // ABM and ACM take orange and green, echoing canvas_0's BL and CL: the
